        "species": 39,
        "text": "Jumping spiders have eight simple eyes, and you very likely have eight as well. If you are a bold jumping spider, your two big front eyes follow a moving target precisely only while the smaller eyes beside them guide them. Nobody has measured what each of your eyes does in most species, so for you the full division of work is unknown.",
        "cites": [
          {
            "id": "jumper#33",
