            "taxon": "Phidippus audax",
            "trait": "eye_role",
            "grade": "m",
            "source": "Jakob 2018"
          }
        ],
        "note": "Left out Lyssomanes (vestigial rear median eyes, R5) and the Menemerus and Habronattus findings (R1, R3) because they belong to other genera and the row would grow past three sentences.",
        "attempt": 1
      },
      {
        "title": "Sharpness",
        "traits": [
          "acuity_cpd",
