            "id": "jumper#35",
            "taxon": "Phidippus johnsoni",
            "trait": "interreceptor_deg",
            "grade": "m",
            "source": "Land 1969"
          }
        ],
        "note": "Removed the 60 minutes per degree figure, which no record states. Left out R3 because its quote gives only a visual angle, and R5 to avoid decimals.",
        "attempt": 2
      },
      {
        "title": "Field of view",
        "traits": [
          "fov_h_deg",
