          {
            "id": "jumper#116",
            "taxon": "Phidippus audax",
            "trait": "fov_h_deg",
            "grade": "m",
            "source": "Goté 2019"
          }
        ],
        "note": "Left out R8 (about 25 degrees of overlap, Blest 1981): it is a genus-level discussion statement and the row's binocular trait is unknown. Also left out the Phidippus johnsoni and Menemerus carried values, since they don't fit one plain sentence.",
        "attempt": 1
