        "text": "A low tone played from more than 3 meters away makes a bold jumping spider freeze, and male brilliant jumping spiders court with vibrations whose rate affects how well they mate. Those are two of the few jumping spiders measured for sound or vibration. Nobody has measured what you hear or feel through your legs if you are any other jumping spider.",
